  :home/welcome_title "Welcome to the MRP System",
  :home/welcome_desc "This Manufacturing Resource Planning (MRP) system lets you manage wooden chair production. Below is an overview of the available modules and how to use them.",
  :home/module_materials "Materials",
  :home/module_materials_desc "Register and manage raw materials (wood, fabric, foam, hardware). Each material tracks current stock and minimum stock levels for inventory control.",
  :home/module_products "Products",
  :home/module_products_desc "Define the finished products (chairs) you manufacture. Each product has a sale price and can be linked to a bill of materials.",
  :home/module_bom "Bill of Materials (BOM)",
  :home/module_bom_desc "Define which materials and quantities are needed to build each product. Includes waste percentage for accurate material requirement calculations.",
  :home/module_suppliers "Suppliers",
  :home/module_suppliers_desc "Register raw material suppliers with their contact information.",
  :home/module_purchases "Purchase Orders",
  :home/module_purchases_desc "Generate purchase orders to suppliers to replenish materials when stock runs low.",
  :home/module_customers "Customers",
  :home/module_customers_desc "Manage customers who place orders for finished products.",
  :home/module_orders "Sales Orders",
  :home/module_orders_desc "Record customer orders with the requested quantities of each product.",
  :home/module_production "Production Orders",
  :home/module_production_desc "Plan and track the manufacturing of products on the shop floor.",
  :home/module_explosion "MRP Explosion",
  :home/module_explosion_desc "Automatically calculate the materials needed to fulfill a sales order, comparing against current stock to identify shortfalls. The system's core tool!",
  :home/tutorial_title "Quick Tutorial",
  :nav/dashboard "Dashboard",
  :home/quick_actions "Quick Actions",
  :home/new_order "New Order",
  :home/workflow_title "MRP Workflow",
  :home/workflow_desc "The MRP process follows this flow: materials → bill of materials → suppliers → purchases → customers → orders → explosion → production.",
  :home/tutorial_step1 "Explore the system modules using the MRP menu in the top navigation bar. Start by reviewing the demo data in Materials and Products to get familiar with the interface.",
  :home/tutorial_step2 "Create a Bill of Materials (BOM) for each product, specifying the materials needed, their quantities, and the expected waste percentage in production.",
  :home/tutorial_step3 "Register suppliers and customers with their contact information. Suppliers provide raw materials; customers place orders for finished products.",
  :home/tutorial_step4 "Generate a Purchase Order when a material's stock is running low. Select the supplier, add lines with materials and quantities, and confirm the order.",
  :home/tutorial_step5 "Create a Sales Order specifying the products and quantities requested by the customer. Each order can contain multiple products with custom pricing.",
  :home/tutorial_step6 "Run the MRP Explosion by selecting an active sales order. The system will calculate the materials needed to fulfill it and compare against current stock to identify shortfalls.",
  :home/tutorial_step7 "Create a Production Order to manufacture products on the shop floor. Track progress by updating its status from planned to in-progress to completed.",
  :home/tutorial_step8 "Check the Dashboard regularly to monitor KPIs, low-stock material alerts, and the status of open production orders.",
  :home/seeded_data "The system includes preloaded demo data with 16 materials, 5 products (executive, dining, folding, rocking, and children's chairs), 5 BOMs, 5 suppliers, 7 customers, and sample orders. Feel free to explore and modify them!",
